  "ownership_notes": [
    "desktop.txt is compositor-neutral and no longer forces niri or xwayland-satellite.",
    "niri.txt owns niri, xwayland-satellite, and xdg-desktop-portal-gnome.",
    "nirimod-git is an optional full-profile niri-only AUR add-on.",
    "hyprland.txt owns Hyprland, its portal/session/idle/lock/wallpaper helpers, HyprMod Python/GTK prerequisites, and awww.",
    "uv intentionally appears in both hyprland.txt and common full.txt: HyprMod needs it, and shared full-profile Python/Git extras also use it.",
    "Common full applications remain common to both compositor profiles. Waybar, SwayNC, wlogout, swaybg, Waypaper, and mpvpaper remain optional shared tools and are not auto-started.",
    "sway and swayidle are preserved in legacy.txt and are not installed by either compositor profile.",
    "Packages listed in omitted.txt are explicitly accounted for but intentionally not installed."
  ],
